  <!-- do we put them into separate files for easier editing later? -->

  <subsection>
    <title>Foundations</title>

    <p>
      In this section of Active Calculus, you will take the algebraic skills you mastered in section 1.2 about limits and apply them to a very specific limit: the limit as <m>h</m> goes to 0 of the average rate of change.  This will require the same sort of algebraic manipulation you practiced in section 1.2, so it would be a good idea to review <xref ref="subsec-limits-foundations"/> before doing additional practice in this section.
    </p>


  </subsection>

